**/target/*
**/.gdb_history
**/kernel8.img

node_modules
.bundle
.vendor

Gemfile.lock
package*.json
/.github/copilot-instructions.md

# Visual Studio's own internal cache/solution index files -- these are locked/actively written to
# while the IDE is open (causing `git add --renormalize .` to fail outright with "Permission
# denied" on .vsidx files), are purely local/machine-specific, and should never be committed.
.vs/

# Local VM disk image and serial/debug logs generated by setupvm.ps1 -- these are large
# (boot.vhdx) and/or machine-specific runtime artifacts, not source.
Shims/hyperv-shim/boot.vhdx
20_timer_callbacks/*.log

# Persistent QEMU filesystem disk, deliberately outside Cargo's target directory.
20_timer_callbacks/rustypi5.img
